      "updated_at": "2019-05-25T19:40:01Z",
      "body": "Hey there. Thanks for the perfectly valid bug report and the extra research on legal requirements 👍 \r\n\r\nI agree that the current setup is less than ideal. I don't know if there's developer resources available to provide the delete option \"the right way\" but historically account deletions are handled by emailing the request to support@bountysource.com. That hasn't been well advertised though. I've just added an FAQ entry for it: https://github.com/bountysource/core/wiki/Frequently-Asked-Questions#how-do-i-delete-my-account\r\n\r\nThat's a stop-gap option at best though, so the request remains valid, and has been for some time - #409 covers it too from a long time ago and I just noticed I even responded there some time ago.",
